title: Currency Stabilisation
subtitle: Treasury: one currency reform, launched in one decision.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_currency.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'currency_stabilisation') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.currency_stabilisation (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.4). Opening and closing
// the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser
// who opened the card. Options that need a system of a later stage are shown with their reason.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'currency_stabilisation');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_currency');
!}

= Currency stabilisation

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The financial crisis goes on, and the reform of the currency has not begun. Choosing a variant starts it at once; when it is completed, the złoty replaces the marka.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @rapid_cuts
- @protected
- @gradual
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@rapid_cuts
title: Rapid stabilisation with savings
subtitle: Costs [+ pl_cost3 +], and the złoty comes after three months; needs adopted cuts; the credit shock grows for three months from the launch (+10). [? if pl_currency_stabilisation_rapid_cuts_coalition : [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_rapid_cuts_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'rapid_cuts').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_rapid_cuts_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'rapid_cuts');
!}
go-to: result

@protected
title: Stabilisation with protections and a burden on wealth
subtitle: Costs [+ pl_cost3 +], and the złoty comes after three months; needs a protection for the unemployed and its financing; the same credit shock. [? if pl_currency_stabilisation_protected_coalition : [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_protected_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'protected').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_protected_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'protected');
!}
go-to: result

@gradual
title: Gradual limitation of emission
subtitle: Costs [+ pl_cost2 +], and the złoty comes after five months; the credit shock grows for five months (+5); the pressure on the marka lasts longer.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'gradual').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_currency_stabilisation_gradual_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'currency_stabilisation', 'gradual');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Currency stabilisation

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
